title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Pending Updates
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the number of pending Debian/APT package updates via
 {/nodes/{node}/apt/update}, the same mechanism used by the PMG web
 GUI's update notification. Configurable WARN/CRIT thresholds on the
 update count (default: WARN at 1, CRIT unset).

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if update data is available from the API.
